SUMMARY:[concept] Kracht: Upper A
DESCRIPTION:Benen rust. Dagelijks (5–8 min): cat-cow ×10\, McGill big 3
  (curl-up\, side plank\, bird dog: 3×10 s per houding)\, hamstring flossi
 ng 2×10 per been.\nBankdrukken (barbell) 3×6–8 @RIR2\nIncline dumbbell
  press 3×8–10 @RIR2\nChest-supported row 3×8–10 @RIR2\nLateral raise
  3×12–15 @RIR1\nCable/machine fly 2×10–12 @RIR1\nTriceps pushdown 2
 ×10–12 @RIR1\nPallof press (per kant) 2×10–12 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
