UID:2026-11-16-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261111T192418Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:[concept] Mobiliteit: Mobiliteit 15 min
DESCRIPTION:Mobiliteit 15 min: ankle rocks 2×10\, 90/90 hip switches 2×8
 \, adductor rocks 2×10\, couch stretch 2×45 s/kant\, calf mobility 2×10
 \, thoracic rotations 2×8/kant.
