DTSTAMP:20261111T192418Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:[concept] Kracht: Lower A (intro\, RIR 3)
DESCRIPTION:Minstens 3 uur na de run. Squat licht terug.\nBack squat 3×5
 –6 @RIR3\nRomanian deadlift 2×6–8 @RIR3\nBulgarian split squat (per b
 een\, dumbbells totaal) 3×6–8 @RIR3\nStaande calf raise 3×8–12 @RIR1
 \nTibialis raise 2×15–20 @RIR1\nCopenhagen plank (sec per kant) 2×20
 –30 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
