UID:2026-11-18-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261111T192418Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261119
SUMMARY:[concept] Plyo: Plyo
DESCRIPTION:Na 10 min warm fietsen. Kwaliteit > volume.\nPogo jumps 2×15\
 nLaterale pogo's (per kant) 2×10\nSnap-down → verticale sprong 3×3\nBo
 x jump (stap eraf) 3×3
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
