 ear delt fly 3×12–15 @RIR1\nIncline dumbbell curl 2×10–12 @RIR1\nHam
 mer curl 2×10–12 @RIR1\nSuitcase carry (meter per kant) 3×30–40 @RIR
 2\nHanging knee raise 3×10–15 @RIR2
